# Secrets for the Worker. For `bun run dev`, copy this file to .dev.vars and fill it in; for a deployed
# Worker, set both secrets using the cf CLI (see README) or the Cloudflare dashboard.
# 32 or more random characters, e.g. from `openssl rand -base64 32`.
SESSION_SECRET=
# Generate independently and back up securely. Never regenerate on deployment: existing browser history
# depends on this value. Changing it requires a history-key migration.
HISTORY_SECRET=
